      {
        "id": "GnarQ",
        "name": "Boomerang Throw / Boulder Toss",
        "description": "Gnar throws a boomerang that damages and slows enemies it hits before returning to him. If he catches the boomerang its cooldown is reduced.<br><br>Mega Gnar instead throws a boulder that stops on the first unit hit, damaging and slowing everything nearby. It can then be picked up to reduce the cooldown.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Mini Gnar:</span> Gnar throws a boomerang that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> physical damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by for seconds. The boomerang returns after hitting an enemy, dealing reduced damage to subsequent targets. Each enemy can only be hit once. Catching the boomerang reduces its Cooldown by.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals 50% damage to enemies beyond the first.</span>",
